<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<nav class="navbar">
  <a href="/">← Home</a>
  <strong>🎓 Students</strong>
</nav>
<div class="container">
  <div class="card">
    <h2>🎓 Student List – EJS Loop Demo</h2>
    <p>Data is an array passed from Express: <code>res.render('students', { students, avg })</code></p>
    <p>EJS iterates using <code>&lt;% students.forEach(s =&gt; &#123; %&gt;</code></p>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>ID</th><th>Name</th><th>Branch</th><th>Marks</th><th>Grade</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <% students.forEach(s => { %>
        <tr>
          <td><%= s.id %></td>
          <td><strong><%= s.name %></strong></td>
          <td><span class="badge"><%= s.branch %></span></td>
          <td><%= s.marks %></td>
          <td>
            <% if (s.marks >= 90) { %>
              <span class="badge green">A+</span>
            <% } else if (s.marks >= 80) { %>
              <span class="badge">A</span>
            <% } else if (s.marks >= 70) { %>
              <span class="badge purple">B</span>
            <% } else { %>
              <span class="badge red">C</span>
            <% } %>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <% }) %>
      </tbody>
      <tfoot>
        <tr><td colspan="3"><strong>Class Average</strong></td><td colspan="2"><strong><%= avg %></strong></td></tr>
      </tfoot>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>
<footer>&copy; 2026 Satyam Koranga – Exp 12</footer>
</body>
</html>
